WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Juri jumps forward into OD Shikusen.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.400
OD Shikusen connects with the grounded Ryu.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.900
The heavy-kick follow-up continues the airborne juggle.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.900
Sakkai Fuhazan starts after Juri lands.

5
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.900
The Level 1 hits continue against airborne Ryu.

6
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.700
The Super finishes in knockdown.
